<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<title>em, i, cite, var, dfn and address are italic</title>
<meta name="assert" content="HTML 15.3.3/15.3.4: em, i, cite, var, dfn and address have font-style: italic."/>
</head>
<body><p><em>em</em> <i>i</i> <cite>cite</cite> <var>var</var> <dfn>dfn</dfn></p>
<address>address</address>
</body>
</html>
